---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { BOOKING_URL } from "../lib/site";
---

<Base seoTitle="Property Management Bookkeeping in Salt Lake City" description="Property management and real estate bookkeeping in Salt Lake City and Salt Lake County. Monthly books, catch-up, tax prep, and reporting.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Property Management and Real Estate Bookkeeping in Salt Lake City</h1>
      <p class="hero-tagline">Serving investors and property managers across the Salt Lake Valley.</p>
      <p>I handle property management bookkeeping and real estate bookkeeping for landlords, managers, and investors in Salt Lake City and throughout Salt Lake County.</p>
      <a href={BOOKING_URL} class="btn btn-hero">Book a Free Call</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section-block">
    <div class="two-col-section">
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Bookkeeping for Salt Lake County Real Estate Investors</h2>
        <p>Salt Lake County is one of the most active real estate markets in Utah. Whether you need property management bookkeeping in Salt Lake City, you're investing in rentals in Sugar House, managing properties in Murray and Sandy, or developing projects in Draper and South Jordan, the financial complexity of your portfolio grows fast.</p>
        <p>Summit Ledger Books works with real estate investors and property managers throughout the Salt Lake Valley. I'm based just north in Kaysville, and my <a href="/services/">bookkeeping services</a> are built specifically for how real estate investors operate in Utah's Wasatch Front market.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img
          src="/assets/bookkeeping-near-me.jpg"
          alt="Real estate bookkeeping services in Salt Lake County, Utah"
          width="600"
          height="400"
          loading="eager"
          style="border-radius: var(--radius-md); width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: cover;"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="outcome-band">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="text-align: center; color: var(--color-navy);">What I Handle for Salt Lake County Clients</h2>
      <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top: var(--space-lg);">
        <a href="/services/portfolio-bookkeeping/" class="card card-link">
          <h3>Rental Property Bookkeeping</h3>
          <p>Monthly reconciliations, transaction categorization, and property-level financial statements for your entire portfolio.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/services/catch-up-bookkeeping/" class="card card-link">
          <h3>Catch-Up Bookkeeping</h3>
          <p>Behind on your records? I'll work through months or years of backlog and bring everything current.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/services/property-management-accounting/" class="card card-link">
          <h3>Property Management Accounting</h3>
          <p>Trust accounting, owner disbursements, rent roll reconciliation, and management fee tracking.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/services/tax-prep-support/" class="card card-link">
          <h3>Tax Preparation Support</h3>
          <p>CPA-ready financials, Schedule E support, and depreciation schedules organized before tax season.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/services/short-term-rental-bookkeeping/" class="card card-link">
          <h3>Short-Term Rental Bookkeeping</h3>
          <p>Platform payout reconciliation, occupancy tax tracking, and property-level P&Ls for Airbnb and VRBO hosts.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/services/financial-reporting/" class="card card-link">
          <h3>Financial Reporting</h3>
          <p>Profit and loss by property, balance sheets, cash flow statements, and investor-ready reports delivered monthly.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/services/construction-bookkeeping/" class="card card-link">
          <h3>Construction &amp; contractor bookkeeping</h3>
          <p>Job costing, progress billing, retainage, and subcontractor 1099s for builders and trades.</p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: var(--space-lg);"><a href="/services/">View all services &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section-block">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="text-align: center;">Why Salt Lake County Clients Choose Me</h2>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-item">
        <h3>I know the Wasatch Front market</h3>
        <p>I'm based in Kaysville and work with investors throughout the Salt Lake Valley. I understand the local rental market, Utah property tax schedules, and the financial rhythms of real estate investing along the Wasatch Front.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <h3>Real estate and construction specialization</h3>
        <p>I specialize in real estate and construction: investors, property managers, developers, builders, and trade contractors. Your books are set up by property, entity, or job, the way your business actually runs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <h3>Certified QuickBooks Online ProAdvisor</h3>
        <p>Your books are maintained in QuickBooks Online so your CPA can work from them directly. No cleanup needed on their end at tax time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-item">
        <h3>Books closed by the 10th</h3>
        <p>Every month, your books are reconciled and your financial statements are delivered by the 10th. No reminders needed, no delays.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section-block">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="text-align: center;">Communities I Serve in Salt Lake County</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--color-text-muted); max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto var(--space-lg);">I work with real estate investors and property managers throughout Salt Lake County, including:</p>
    <div class="location-grid">
      <span class="location-tag">Salt Lake City</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Sandy</span>
      <span class="location-tag">West Jordan</span>
      <span class="location-tag">South Jordan</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Murray</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Draper</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Riverton</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Taylorsville</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Cottonwood Heights</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Holladay</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Midvale</span>
      <span class="location-tag">West Valley City</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Herriman</span>
      <span class="location-tag">Millcreek</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section-block">
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="text-align: center;">From the Blog</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">Practical guidance for real estate investors managing rental properties.</p>
    <div class="article-related-links" style="justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-lg); flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <a href="/blog/chart-of-accounts-rental-properties/">How to Set Up a Chart of Accounts &rarr;</a>
      <a href="/blog/real-estate-bookkeeping-mistakes/">5 Bookkeeping Mistakes Investors Make &rarr;</a>
      <a href="/blog/security-deposits-bookkeeping/">Security Deposits: How to Record Correctly &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container" style="text-align: center; padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
    <h2 class="section-heading">Ready to get your books in order?</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">Schedule a free consultation and I'll walk through your portfolio, your current bookkeeping setup, and what getting organized looks like.</p>
    <a href={BOOKING_URL} class="btn btn-primary">Book a Free Call</a>
  </section>

</Base>
